{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enter Ground Seal, a Lo-fi Retro Sandbox RPG!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up in the future to a world with humanity on the brink of extinction. Discover the source of the radiation threatening the world and save civilization from a mysterious threat. This sandbox RPG features a gigantic world to explore, robust town building mechanics and a wide variety of items to craft!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Free Demo includes the first 3 regions. In the full game you can even travel to different planets!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gigantic world to explore, procedural generation creates overlapping regions and you can even travel to different planets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic day/night cycle. Different enemies may come out at night and even the seasons change in some regions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG Leveling System - Level up as you explore, fight mutants and complete quests. Tailor your build by spending skill points and specialize in melee, ranged, energy or minions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over a thousand items to craft and find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Person Multiplayer - Have your friends join to build, explore and fight a variety of epic bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NPC Classes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue NPCs and add them to your towns. They will perform tasks for you based upon their building's role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Forester.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Blacksmith.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Doctor.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Soldier.png?t=1745190259\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover different civilizations and build unique settlements on other planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Xythian.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Robot.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Lunite.png?t=1745190259\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intricate Electrical Systems. Wire up lights, machines and other gadgets. Control lighting and electrical signals through network controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Electrical.png?t=1745190259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automation - Link machines together with tubes and conveyer belts to create advanced recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Machinery.png?t=1745190259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced town building features. Add buildings and assign them roles such as Blacksmith, Hospital, Forester and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Buildings.png?t=1745190259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630840?t=1745190259","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/c6b9104030e61ba01efa2db3b71fda07397e2410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745190259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/98959da2c0156b3b4face830a6439f3e7c841df3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745190259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/98959da2c0156b3b4face830a6439f3e7c841df3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745190259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enter Ground Seal, a Lo-fi Retro Sandbox RPG!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up in the future to a world with humanity on the brink of extinction. Discover the source of the radiation threatening the world and save civilization from a mysterious threat. This sandbox RPG features a gigantic world to explore, robust town building mechanics and a wide variety of items to craft!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Free Demo includes the first 3 regions. In the full game you can even travel to different planets!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gigantic world to explore, procedural generation creates overlapping regions and you can even travel to different planets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic day/night cycle. Different enemies may come out at night and even the seasons change in some regions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG Leveling System - Level up as you explore, fight mutants and complete quests. Tailor your build by spending skill points and specialize in melee, ranged, energy or minions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over a thousand items to craft and find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Person Multiplayer - Have your friends join to build, explore and fight a variety of epic bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NPC Classes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue NPCs and add them to your towns. They will perform tasks for you based upon their building's role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Forester.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Blacksmith.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Doctor.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Soldier.png?t=1745190259\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover different civilizations and build unique settlements on other planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Xythian.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Robot.png?t=1745190259\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Lunite.png?t=1745190259\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intricate Electrical Systems. Wire up lights, machines and other gadgets. Control lighting and electrical signals through network controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Electrical.png?t=1745190259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automation - Link machines together with tubes and conveyer belts to create advanced recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Machinery.png?t=1745190259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced town building features. Add buildings and assign them roles such as Blacksmith, Hospital, Forester and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/extras/Buildings.png?t=1745190259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["TBone Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3175290","name":"Ground Seal"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630840/1ecf83268430fbcbc843cbc11c908316f8137626/header.jpg?t=1745190259","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119939,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119939/movie480.mp4?t=1745190258","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119939/movie_max.mp4?t=1745190258"},"name":"Ground Seal Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119939/6ffc0fb6451027750b5b08d25fc6419ce0d3e409/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745190258","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119939/